OL,3,GNEWSAProsecutors seeking retrial in
OL,4,Acase of woman who killed abusive
OL,5,Apartner
OL,6,
OL,7,FProsecutors are seeking a retrial in
OL,8,Fthe case of a woman who stabbed her
OL,9,Fabusive partner to death.
OL,11,FJulie Ann McIlwaine was convicted of
OL,12,Fmurder in 2025 but had that conviction
OL,13,Foverturned on appeal earlier this
OL,14,Fmonth.
OL,16,FA defence barrister for McIlwaine said
OL,17,Fthe court of appeal should consider
OL,18,Fsubstituting a verdict.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
